{"repo": "python-poetry/poetry", "pull_number": 11081, "instance_id": "python-poetry__poetry-11081", "issue_numbers": ["11080"], "base_commit": "4acc75e19f128c8340c6f977a35e53b5f7f39071", "patch": "diff --git a/src/poetry/utils/authenticator.py b/src/poetry/utils/authenticator.py\nindex c33ae69fc95..22d1a6a7869 100644\n--- a/src/poetry/utils/authenticator.py\n+++ b/src/poetry/utils/authenticator.py\n@@ -418,6 +418,11 @@ def configured_repositories(self) -> dict[str, AuthenticatorRepositoryConfig]:\n             self._configured_repositories = {}\n             for repository_name in self._config.get(\"repositories\", []):\n                 url = self._config.get([\"repositories\", repository_name, \"url\"])\n+                if not url:\n+                    raise PoetryError(\n+                        f\"The repository {repository_name!r} is missing a url. \"\n+                        f\"Please set it with `poetry config repositories.{repository_name} <url>`.\"\n+                    )\n                 self._configured_repositories[repository_name] = (\n                     AuthenticatorRepositoryConfig(repository_name, url)\n                 )\n", "test_patch": "diff --git a/tests/utils/test_authenticator.py b/tests/utils/test_authenticator.py\nindex be267c1772d..c14509e6bfe 100644\n--- a/tests/utils/test_authenticator.py\n+++ b/tests/utils/test_authenticator.py\n@@ -17,6 +17,7 @@\n from keyring.credentials import SimpleCredential\n \n from poetry.console.exceptions import PoetryRuntimeError\n+from poetry.exceptions import PoetryError\n from poetry.utils.authenticator import Authenticator\n from poetry.utils.authenticator import AuthenticatorRepositoryConfig\n from poetry.utils.authenticator import RepositoryCertificateConfig\n@@ -638,6 +639,22 @@ def test_repository_config_path_match_key(\n     assert repository.path_match_key(request_path) == expected\n \n \n+def test_authenticator_raises_error_for_empty_repository_section_without_url(\n+    config: Config,\n+) -> None:\n+    # Reproducer for #11080: empty [repositories.<name>] section with no url key\n+    config.merge({\"repositories\": {\"company-internal\": {}}})\n+\n+    authenticator = Authenticator(config, NullIO())\n+    with pytest.raises(PoetryError) as exc_info:\n+        _ = authenticator.configured_repositories\n+\n+    assert str(exc_info.value) == (\n+        \"The repository 'company-internal' is missing a url. \"\n+        \"Please set it with `poetry config repositories.company-internal <url>`.\"\n+    )\n+\n+\n @pytest.mark.parametrize(\n     (\"url\", \"expected\"),\n     [\n", "problem_statement": "Poetry 2.5.0/2.5.1 TypeError str instead of bytes-like object\n### Description\n\nJust after upgrading poetry (poetry self update or uninstall / install with script) from 1.4.3, poetry refuses every command excepted help with this error (see complete backtrace bellow):\n```\n$ poetry install --with dev,test\n\na bytes-like object is required, not 'str'\n$ poetry self update\n\na bytes-like object is required, not 'str'\n```\n\nThe error is happening with both poetry 2.5.0 and 2.5.1\n\nUpdate: this error is caused by an undefined `url` field in `config.toml` for a repository.\n\n### Workarounds\n\nGoing back to 2.4.3 fixes the issue.\n\n```bash\ncurl -sSL https://install.python-poetry.org | python3 - --uninstall\ncurl -sSL https://install.python-poetry.org | python3 - --version 2.4.3\n```\n\n### Poetry Installation Method\n\ninstall.python-poetry.org\n\n### Operating System\n\nUbuntu 24.04 (KDE Plasma)\n\n### Poetry Version\n\n2.5.1\n\n### Poetry Configuration\n\n```bash session\ncache-dir = \"/home/<user>/.cache/pypoetry\"\ndata-dir = \"/home/<user>/.local/share/pypoetry\"\ninstaller.max-workers = null\ninstaller.no-binary = null\ninstaller.only-binary = null\ninstaller.parallel = true\ninstaller.re-resolve = false\nkeyring.enabled = true\npython.installation-dir = \"{data-dir}/python\"  # /home/<user>/.local/share/pypoetry/python\nrepositories.pypi-internal.url = \"https://pypi-internal.host/simple/\"\nrepositories.pypi-internal-upload.url = \"https://pypi-internal.host\"\nrepositories.pypi-proxy.url = \"https://pypi-proxy.host\"\nrequests.max-retries = 0\nsolver.lazy-wheel = true\nsolver.min-release-age = 0\nsolver.min-release-age-exclude = null\nsolver.min-release-age-exclude-source = null\nsystem-git-client = false\nvirtualenvs.create = true\nvirtualenvs.in-project = null\nvirtualenvs.options.always-copy = false\nvirtualenvs.options.no-pip = false\nvirtualenvs.options.system-site-packages = false\nvirtualenvs.path = \"{cache-dir}/virtualenvs\"  # /home/<user>/.cache/pypoetry/virtualenvs\nvirtualenvs.prompt = \"{project_name}-py{python_version}\"\nvirtualenvs.use-poetry-python = false\n```\n\n### Python Sysconfig\n\n<details>\n  <summary>sysconfig.log</summary>\n  <!-- Please leave one blank line below for enabling the code block rendering. -->\n\n  ```\n  Platform: \"linux-x86_64\"\nPython version: \"3.12\"\nCurrent installation scheme: \"venv\"\n\nPaths: \n        data = \"/home/<user>/.local/share/pypoetry/venv\"\n        include = \"/home/<user>/.pyenv/versions/3.12.12/include/python3.12\"\n        platinclude = \"/home/<user>/.pyenv/versions/3.12.12/include/python3.12\"\n        platlib = \"/home/<user>/.local/share/pypoetry/venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages\"\n        platstdlib = \"/home/<user>/.local/share/pypoetry/venv/lib/python3.12\"\n        purelib = \"/home/<user>/.local/share/pypoetry/venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages\"\n        scripts = \"/home/<user>/.local/share/pypoetry/venv/bin\"\n        stdlib = \"/home/<user>/.pyenv/versions/3.12.12/lib/python3.12\"\n\nVariables: \n        ABIFLAGS = \"\"\n        AC_APPLE_UNIVERSAL_BUILD = \"0\"\n        AIX_BUILDDATE = \"0\"\n        AIX_GENUINE_CPLUSPLUS = \"0\"\n        ALIGNOF_LONG = \"8\"\n        ALIGNOF_MAX_ALIGN_T = \"16\"\n        ALIGNOF_SIZE_T = \"8\"\n        ALT_SOABI = \"0\"\n        ANDROID_API_LEVEL = \"0\"\n        AR = \"ar\"\n        ARFLAG